.venv
.vscode
.session_logs
session_logs
.session_backups
__pycache__
data
# The authoring sources (.docx/.rtf) and their screenshots stay out; the
# PDFs are the deliverable and ship inside the installer, so they are
# tracked. Written as documentation/* rather than documentation, because
# git will not descend into an excluded directory and a negation inside
# one has no effect.
documentation/*
!documentation/*.pdf
*.txt
!requirements.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
*.tex
!tests/fixtures/**/*.tex
*.zip
*.png
!icons/*.png
*.log
.pytest_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
build
dist
dist_installer
